      "decision_index": 43,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Chose to kill Benalish Honor Guard (3/2) with Strangling Spores instead of Kwende, Pride of Femeref (2/2 double strike). Kwende is the far more threatening creature - it has double strike itself (effectively 4 damage per attack), grants double strike to first strikers, and its legendary status gives Honor Guard +1/+0. Removing Kwende would both eliminate the bigger threat AND weaken Honor Guard to a vanilla 2/2.",
      "action_taken": "Targeted Benalish Honor Guard with Strangling Spores",
